{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Policy corrections amended at exact SHA 1f0a8088932e6164925097421f31270d5985b3bc. Change-Id I67d22f30f5c0b1e330cbe9ea79732d5efd6e6640. Provider-backed behavior is now described by mechanism, the prohibited semicolons are removed, and the workflow comments retain the 1, 2, 3 sequence. The prose-only guard, seven-test collection, 15 focused consumer tests, diff integrity, trailer validation, repository lint and typecheck, and clean worktree all pass. Full make verify is deferred to Gerrit CI per operator direction. A fresh independent 12-row receipt is still required."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788909390186423001,"uuid":"1da14dcf-be29-47d4-8769-103eaf7c65be"}